     fhir:div [ fhir:v "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><div xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\"><hr/><p><b>English</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: Requirements SGAuthoring.Skills.ValidateDAKContent</b></p><a name=\"SGAuthoring.Skills.ValidateDAKContent\"> </a><a name=\"hcSGAuthoring.Skills.ValidateDAKContent\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profile: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-SGRequirements.html\">SMART Guidelines Requirements</a></p></div><p>These requirements apply to the following actors: </p><ul><li><a href=\"ActorDefinition-SGAuthoring.Persona.BusinessAnalyst.html\">Business Analyst</a></li><li><a href=\"ActorDefinition-SGAuthoring.Persona.ClinicalSME.html\">Clinical Subject Matter Expert</a></li></ul><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b><a name=\"DAKVAL-01\"> </a></b>Verify L1 accuracy</td><td>SHALL</td><td><div><p>Can verify that DAK components accurately reflect L1 recommendations.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"DAKVAL-02\"> </a></b>Identify gaps and changes</td><td>SHALL</td><td><div><p>Can identify gaps, key changes, and alternatives in DAK content.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"DAKVAL-03\"> </a></b>Verify software neutrality</td><td>SHALL</td><td><div><p>Can verify that DAK components are software-neutral and do not assume any specific software or device.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"DAKVAL-04\"> </a></b>Streamline cross-component consistency</td><td>SHALL</td><td><div><p>Can review DAK for cross-component consistency: persona naming, data element usage, workflow alignment, and requirement linkage.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"DAKVAL-05\"> </a></b>Incorporate SME feedback</td><td>SHALL</td><td><div><p>Can analyse feedback from SMEs, identify patterns, incorporate changes, and confirm accurate reflection of suggestions.</p>\n</div></td></tr></table></div><div xml:lang=\"fr\" lang=\"fr\"><hr/><p><b>French</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Narratif généré : Requirements SGAuthoring.Skills.ValidateDAKContent</b></p><a name=\"fr-SGAuthoring.Skills.ValidateDAKContent\"> </a><a name=\"fr-hcSGAuthoring.Skills.ValidateDAKContent\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profil: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-SGRequirements.html\">SMART Guidelines Requirements</a></p></div><p>Ces exigences s'appliquent aux acteurs suivants : </p><ul><li><a href=\"ActorDefinition-SGAuthoring.Persona.BusinessAnalyst.html\">Business Analyst</a></li><li><a href=\"ActorDefinition-SGAuthoring.Persona.ClinicalSME.html\">Clinical Subject Matter Expert</a></li></ul><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-DAKVAL-01\"> </a></b>Verify L1 accuracy</td><td>SHALL</td><td><div><p>Can verify that DAK components accurately reflect L1 recommendations.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-DAKVAL-02\"> </a></b>Identify gaps and changes</td><td>SHALL</td><td><div><p>Can identify gaps, key changes, and alternatives in DAK content.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-DAKVAL-03\"> </a></b>Verify software neutrality</td><td>SHALL</td><td><div><p>Can verify that DAK components are software-neutral and do not assume any specific software or device.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-DAKVAL-04\"> </a></b>Streamline cross-component consistency</td><td>SHALL</td><td><div><p>Can review DAK for cross-component consistency: persona naming, data element usage, workflow alignment, and requirement linkage.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-DAKVAL-05\"> </a></b>Incorporate SME feedback</td><td>SHALL</td><td><div><p>Can analyse feedback from SMEs, identify patterns, incorporate changes, and confirm accurate reflection of suggestions.</p>\n</div></td></tr></table></div><div xml:lang=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><hr/><p><b>Arabic</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>السرد المُنشأ: Requirements SGAuthoring.Skills.ValidateDAKContent</b></p><a name=\"ar-SGAuthoring.Skills.ValidateDAKContent\"> </a><a name=\"ar-hcSGAuthoring.Skills.ValidateDAKContent\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">الملف الشخصي: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-SGRequirements.html\">SMART Guidelines Requirements</a></p></div><p>تنطبق هذه المتطلبات على الجهات التالية </p><ul><li><a href=\"ActorDefinition-SGAuthoring.Persona.BusinessAnalyst.html\">Business Analyst</a></li><li><a href=\"ActorDefinition-SGAuthoring.Persona.ClinicalSME.html\">Clinical Subject Matter Expert</a></li></ul><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b><a name=\"ar-DAKVAL-01\"> </a></b>Verify L1 accuracy</td><td>SHALL</td><td><div><p>Can verify that DAK components accurately reflect L1 recommendations.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"ar-DAKVAL-02\"> </a></b>Identify gaps and changes</td><td>SHALL</td><td><div><p>Can identify gaps, key changes, and alternatives in DAK content.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"ar-DAKVAL-03\"> </a></b>Verify software neutrality</td><td>SHALL</td><td><div><p>Can verify that DAK components are software-neutral and do not assume any specific software or device.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"ar-DAKVAL-04\"> </a></b>Streamline cross-component consistency</td><td>SHALL</td><td><div><p>Can review DAK for cross-component consistency: persona naming, data element usage, workflow alignment, and requirement linkage.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"ar-DAKVAL-05\"> </a></b>Incorporate SME feedback</td><td>SHALL</td><td><div><p>Can analyse feedback from SMEs, identify patt